{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1847","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Triangle Platinum?"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a rather curious Stand. Of course, it is (arguably) the strongest Stand in existence, but it is also an ardent puzzle enjoyer. For example, it gave Qtaro the following problem recently:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" has $$$n$$$ hidden integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$3 \\le n \\le 5000$$$, $$$1 \\le a_i \\le 4$$$). Qtaro must determine all the $$$a_i$$$ by asking "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" some queries of the following form: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In one query Qtaro is allowed to give "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" three "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" indexes $$$i$$$, $$$j$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i, j, k \\leq n$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$a_i, a_j, a_k$$$ form the sides of a non-degenerate triangle$$$^\\dagger$$$, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will respond with the area of this triangle. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Otherwise, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will respond with $$$0$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"By asking at most $$$5500$$$ such questions, Qtaro must either tell "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made in Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" all the values of the $$$a_i$$$, or report that it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" possible to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"uniquely"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" determine them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately due to the universe reboot, Qtaro is not as smart as Jotaro. Please help Qtaro solve "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Made In Heaven"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'s problem. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" —————————————————————— "}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^\\dagger$$$ Three positive integers $$$a, b, c$$$ are said to form the sides of a non-degenerate triangle if and only if all of the following three inequalities hold: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a+b \\gt c$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b+c \\gt a$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$c+a \\gt b$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The interaction begins with reading $$$n$$$ ($$$3 \\le n \\le 5000$$$), the number of hidden integers. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To ask a question corresponding to the triple $$$(i, j, k)$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\lt j \\lt k \\leq n$$$), output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$i$$$ $$$j$$$ $$$k$$$\" without quotes. Afterward, you should read a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"single integer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$s$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$s = 0$$$, then $$$a_i$$$, $$$a_j$$$, and $$$a_k$$$ are not the sides of a non-degenerate triangle. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Otherwise, $$$s = 16 \\Delta^2$$$, where $$$\\Delta$$$ is the area of the triangle. The area is provided in this format for your convenience so that you need only take integer input. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the numbers $$$a_i$$$ cannot be uniquely determined print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$-1$$$\" without quotes. On the other hand, if you have determined all the values of $$$a_i$$$ print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1$$$ $$$a_2$$$ $$$\\dots$$$ $$$a_n$$$\" on a single line."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The interactor is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-adaptive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". The hidden array $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fixed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" beforehand and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"is not changed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" during the interaction process."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing a query do not forget to output the end of line and flush the output. Otherwise, you will get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". To do this, use: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"System.out.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Java; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"flush(output)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Pascal; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can hack a solution with the following input format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$3 \\le n \\le 5000$$$) — the number of hidden integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 4$$$) — the hidden array."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"ki